   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official VMware Engine API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. VMware Engine networks and network policies are configuration metadata: no private cloud, vCenter, NSX, VPC, internet access or external IP service is provisioned, and networks report ACTIVE immediately. Only STANDARD networks are accepted. The simulator does not check that a network is created in the global location or that a policy's network exists. Private clouds are not served because they live in zone locations. Only descriptions and edge services CIDR ranges can be updated. Long-running operations complete synchronously.",
